{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e1413e2a60605a79f2c240e33c171c940ffdfe60ba7a16a5d4b22f9928b3970d", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\n未来も、制服に着替え終わった頃だと思うが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n未来应该也已经换好制服了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "67d6270f5d33b9b20c766512b0bbaee2e7172db4dfc7ac7d08f1ace08ee19210", "ja": "{$P$}さ～～～～ん！", "zh": "{$P$}先～～～～生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "6224a7d3aed107a709c1eab943624e5627c1776cf3c1313b570bc89ba077c1e2", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……\nふぅー、気持ちよかった♪", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……\n呼——真舒服♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a6e69d352f00d6b9cc3974dc9b57bd33c3299286f1802417db244b5aa7f512a2", "ja": "お疲れさま、未来。\n……なんで廊下を走ってきたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。\n……你干吗在走廊上跑过来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "f1f7f959b44a276a8c86cd2fb93d8cb6e88d0b978b7750be5fdd1f4350581a74", "ja": "だって、学校で廊下を走ると\n先生に怒られちゃうじゃないですか！", "zh": "因为，在学校走廊上奔跑的话，\n会被老师骂的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "1209e11bcf7caa151c327607ebb85b3cb9488c5b85f0bdc6045bbe789e4e84b2", "ja": "廊下ってこ～んなに真っすぐで長いんだから、\n思いっきり走ってみたいな～って思ってたんです♪", "zh": "走廊明明这～么笔直又这么长，\n我早就想着一定要尽情跑一次试试看了嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2a9cea1df489d518580ad03a16bae0f6518c255645537cfd906582d682105b67", "ja": "なるほど……今日は貸し切りだし、\n思いっきり走っても怒られないな。", "zh": "原来如此……今天包场了，\n尽情奔跑也不会被骂了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "42f3d1c1e6c7224d6ac913dde47095974ec4bf9206b0f4875456d853dcf587ad", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さん、\n学校って面白そうなものがいっぱいですよね？", "zh": "是的！{$P$}先生，学校里好像有好多有趣的东西呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "2077b62e4c6b0497fa57f3ab5506f0b9d7163d01cd0426a091ad3413ee7f80f6", "ja": "今日は先生がいないし、やってみたかったことが\nたくさん試せそうだなーって♪", "zh": "今天老师不在，感觉可以试试很多一直想做的事呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1009_p", "source_sha256": "674aef11c05d3000be0cdb00ace3e059245e93d66ed5ce3d1597edf0b1c2e02b", "ja": "学校でやってみたかった事か……なるほど。そういう\nテーマで撮影してもらうのも、面白いかもしれないな。", "zh": "在学校里想尝试做的事吗……原来如此。以这种\n主题来让他们拍摄，说不定也挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "c0a8c9e3981100379844a9b0f99ecca2817bcee14dc36b7145d73ab89623e827", "ja": "ホントですか！？　あとは、窓から外に出るとか。\nエアコンの温度を変えるのと……あっ、そうそう！", "zh": "真的吗！？还有从窗户到外面去之类的。再把空调温度调一调……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "75ad22667861692804dc40bd1ee6c9849487a00f0cf91dae0c57e280a958dc75", "ja": "それから、あのボタンも！\n私、ず～っと、押してみたかったんですよね♪", "zh": "还有那个按钮！\n我一直都很想按按看呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4d366bc3109c2962321e21506cc54c9b5a7eab6677386b265b80c0abeef02cee", "ja": "あのボタン？", "zh": "哪个按钮？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "d6b29cc6f912c607205d9bec590978f9eec18f9eac497f76b456e9b4a276d1a0", "ja": "あれです！\n廊下の壁にくっついてる、赤い……。", "zh": "就是那个！\n贴在走廊墙上的红色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f0fe666b3f36e3661300a7a5225b8c0e400d3a42fe2932bbb208c724a18677bb", "ja": "未来、それはもしかして……。", "zh": "未来，难道那个是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "7dd053c691aff352415d2bd7eeb15704cec669d98626f93befe1ebf598325487", "ja": "『強く押す』って書いてあるのに、\n押しちゃダメって言われるんですよね～。", "zh": "明明写着“用力按”，\n却被告知不能按呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1016_p", "source_sha256": "70ed24a1b75ad4b486bb1b5b73d045e0985b2a8cf2563356b04ed08922ecf95e", "ja": "やっぱり、非常ボタンのことか。\nまあ、押してみたくなる気持ちはわかるけど……。", "zh": "果然是指紧急按钮啊。\n不过，那种想按按看的心情我倒是挺能理解的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "9c9b4919a757e227db3307909d5f63f1d65c6cc70a3c54e67836b0bac9420425", "ja": "ですよね！？　じゃあ、\n{$P$}さんも一緒に押しませんか？", "zh": "就是嘛！？那要不要和{$P$}先生一起按？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8194425fc73f47ee66550b7f4a6a66b60c5f00eed7b0b5d884c115a03e54bdfe", "ja": "待て待て、非常ボタンは流石にダメだろう。\nスタッフさん達に、迷惑が……。", "zh": "等等等等，紧急按钮可万万按不得啊。\n会给工作人员们添麻烦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1019_staff", "source_sha256": "2bb0cd1798ea3e08cb8addfb4f7eb02585c34350d43c24909cabcc25d19942cd", "ja": "春日さん、そろそろスタンバイお願いしまーす！", "zh": "春日小姐，差不多该准备就位了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6627dedba8214b71aa2b850b3b97f65b3943cc2b9016144629bd9121f31ffb45", "ja": "おっ、ちょうど撮影の準備が出来たみたいだぞ！\nそれじゃ未来、教室の方に……。", "zh": "哦，正好像是拍摄准备好了！\n那么未来，往教室那边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "735b2be2851cda42b295acaae8f46404728d2009e60e1e6596797f5c0eb004b2", "ja": "えっ？　あっ、はい！\n……わわっ！？", "zh": "诶？啊，好的！\n……哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1022_se", "source_sha256": "09d9010abd406337009957dbe168c6b87e0b296be74f08c0b583f8e4bbf38375", "ja": "ジリリリリリリリリリ！", "zh": "叮铃铃铃铃铃铃铃铃铃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1023_p", "source_sha256": "750a3537d2fbd497f13b5d1481e01a3845c856862d456902a75781b34ae2f8fa", "ja": "未来、大丈夫か！？　……あ！", "zh": "未来，没事吧！？……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "edc0699c990b9000761ffd2e7c3f7803d2e5f204796cd30df9e5ab010486718d", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい……転んだ拍子に、\n思いっきり押しちゃいました……。でへへ……。", "zh": "对、对不起……摔倒的时候，一不小心使劲按下去了……嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0183_1025_p", "source_sha256": "004e3ce8bf1c27769398817399f511d2cf96206d2efc9e366ad0b3e30d8ea1d9", "ja": "（非常ボタンの件は事故という事で、注意だけで\n終わった。未来の学生生活、賑やかそうだな……）", "zh": "（紧急按钮那件事就当作意外，只是提醒了一下便结束了。未来的校园生活，看来会很热闹啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
